      "text": "Introducing SuperCmd v2 🚀 - Completely rebuilt in Swift for native performance. Raycast alternative.\n\n3x less memory usage compared to Raycast ⚡️\n50mb on disk, completely local, full privacy!\n\nAll the features from SuperCmd v1 including Raycast extensions support!\n\nAnd here's what's new in v2 ✨\n• CleanShotX styled screenshot tool\n• Windows styled alt + tab tile manager\n• Widgets in main launcher\n• Login via ChatGPT (no need to pay for AI subs)\n• AI Agents with harness (directory aware)\n• Voice based AI agents powered by @OpenAI GPT realtime (just like clicky)\n• Execute terminal commands from launcher\n• Double tap as hotkey support\n• Dedicated AI chat window with web search\n• Translate command\n• Browser search with history & profiles\n• Custom paths for file search\nhttp://supercmd.sh/new",
