      "text": "Introducing Licht Cinema Camera.\n\nFilm the way you remember. The moment was cinema. Now the footage is too.\n\nI call it Licht. German for light.\n\nLicht is built around two essentials: the camera you hold, and the image pipeline inside it. One is how it feels. One is how it sees. Together, a camera experience unlike anything else on your iPhone.\n\nI poured my whole heart into this one. You'll see and feel it.\n\nRead the story and join the waitlist below.",
